# TypeScript is text. metrics-client.ts once carried raw NUL bytes as a group-key
# separator, which made git classify it binary and render its diff as "Binary file
# not shown" — on the file with the most logic in it. The bytes are gone, but this
# keeps a stray one from ever hiding a diff again.
*.ts   text diff
*.js   text diff
*.css  text diff
*.html text diff
*.md   text diff
